  "reviewKind": "Worker visual inspection of current anatomical/polish candidate; not independent PASS or final Owner acceptance",
  "observations": [
    "All fifteen civilians inspected in Idle/Walk/Talking at four phases from front, side and rear: 180 poses and 540 tiles. No severe body-through-cloth or broken limb deformation observed in these admitted samples. Profile-only shoulder-facing failures and disconnected vest bindings found during pre-review were corrected before the current captures.",
    "Bare front/three-quarter/profile views and complete portraits expose real anatomical eyes/lids/brows, lips, nose, jaw and age differences. Current CC0 heads replace the rejected Quaternius heads. Female faces have no facial-hair geometry or upper-lip marks reading as moustaches. Calm/welcoming, smiling and grumpy resting moods remain restrained; some anatomical family resemblance remains.",
    "Fifteen conversation views and three player views inspected under actual unchanged ENV sun/renderer/volumes and 55-degree camera in the isolated snapshot. Eyes are more integrated and facial planes retain volume; shadowed stations and fabric weave are more contrasty than the studio fixture. Final subjective ENV/retro quality acceptance remains with the Owner.",
    "Full unmasked throat support weights, concealed-clavicle crop before facing measurement, 20 mm skin/facing overlap and supporting-shirt apron/overall ribbons remove large shoulder intersections. Vest edge bindings share corners with bounded rounding. Angular lapels/neckline edges and small rear inner-collar peeks remain close-up art limits; clothes remain the weakest surface.",
    "All 24 distance sheets inspected at native 640/1920 widths, each containing three separate camera batches of five people. Height, mass, apron/skirt/jacket/hat/bag and role cues carry identity. Fine facial detail is not individually readable at 20m/640 and is not claimed.",
    "Separate ordinary Play-Mode live recording reviewed at open and near-closed lid frames; 95 frames over eight seconds use Animator/LateUpdate, with no direct sampling calls or error. Controlled fifteen-person living audit verifies per-ID irregular blink, two closures, four ocular shapes, target bounds/absence/invalid time and disable restoration. Actual GC2 Player attention is also observed for all fifteen in ENV.",
    "Breathing and weight shifts remain owned by the admitted Animator. Hands/feet stay attached; Talking retains functioning fingers and shared ANIM dynamics. Resting expression plus blink/gaze does not certify lipsync, facial dialogue acting, autonomous navigation or final town dialogue integration.",
    "Aprons/skirts remain weighted low-poly sheets with limited lateral volume. No cloth collision, arbitrary contacts, running/sitting or arbitrary blending is admitted. Current finite/bounds checks and empty problems are not a waiver for an observed visual or fit failure."
  ],
